			<section id="getting-started">
				<h2>🚀 Getting Started with The Purchaser Tracker</h2>
				<p>Welcome to <strong>The Purchaser Tracker</strong> – a digital platform to streamline B2B inquiries between purchasers and sellers of Raw and Packing Materials.</p>
				
				<p>To begin using the system:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>🌐 Visit the official website: 
					<a href="https://thetracker.in" target="_blank">https://thetracker.in</a>
					</li>
					<li>📝 If you're a new company, register here:
					<a href="https://thepurchasetracker.com/Login" target="_blank">https://thepurchasetracker.com/Login</a>
					</li>
					<li>🔐 Note: All companies must receive <strong>Admin approval</strong> before participating in inquiries.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section id="intro">
				<h2>📘 Introduction to The Purchaser Tracker</h2>			
				<p>
				<strong>The Purchaser Tracker</strong> is a cloud-based procurement and inquiry management system designed to streamline the sourcing of Raw Materials (RM) and Packing Materials (PM) by connecting purchasers and sellers in real time.
				</p>
				 <p>
					This system allows purchasers to raise product inquiries to multiple sellers, and enables sellers to respond with price quotations, terms, and delivery timelines. It simplifies the negotiation workflow, allows for revision handling, and supports final deal confirmation through purchase order generation.
				</p>
				<p>
					The system ensures traceability, speed, and accuracy at every stage of procurement while reducing manual coordination. Features like auto-reply configuration, product-wise terms & conditions, warehouse dispatch management, and real-time notifications make this system scalable for manufacturers, traders, and distributors.
				</p>
				
				<h3>🎯 Key Objectives:</h3>
				<ul>
					<li>Standardize and digitize purchaser-to-seller inquiry workflows</li>
					<li>Enable multi-seller quotations for transparent pricing</li>
					<li>Support negotiation with revision and final pricing flows</li>
					<li>Automate purchase order creation post-final deal</li>
					<li>Provide reports for performance tracking and price analytics</li>
				</ul>

				<h3>👥 Who Uses This System?</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Purchasers:</strong> Create inquiries, compare seller replies, submit revised offers, and generate POs</li>
					<li><strong>Sellers:</strong> Receive inquiries, reply with offers, handle negotiations, and finalize quotes</li>
					<li><strong>Admins:</strong> To manage master data (products, categories), product approvals and workflow configurations</li>
				</ul>

				
				<p><strong>Ready to get started?</strong> 
					<a href="https://thepurchasetracker.com/Login" target="_blank">Click here to register your company</a> and begin your journey.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section id="registration">
