			<section id="admin-panel">
				<h2>⚙️ Admin Panel</h2>
				<p>Admin users have access to the full backend management system. They can approve product and company
					requests, configure master settings, and manage users. This includes activating/deactivating users,
					assigning rules, and overseeing inquiry workflows.</p>


