					<section id="Seller_Purchaser">
						<h2>📘 Seller to Purchaser – Inquiry Response Process</h2>
						<p>
							This module allows <strong>Sellers</strong> to view inquiries submitted by purchasers, respond with quotations, negotiate pricing, and submit final offers. The process supports both manual and automated replies.
						</p>

						<h3>🔔 Step 1: Receive Inquiry Notification</h3>
						<ul>
							<li>You will be notified via the 🔔 bell icon when a purchaser submits an inquiry for a product you have listed in your <strong>My Product Master</strong>.</li>
							<li>Click the notification or go to <strong>Inquiry Reply Master</strong>.<br>
								<em><strong>Example:</strong> "New Inquiry Received - Imidacloprid 17.8% SL"</em>
							</li>
							<li>Filter inquiries by RM/PM, Date, or Status.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/1.InquiryNotification.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – New Inquiry Notification</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/1.InquiryNotification.jpg" alt=" New Inquiry Notification">
							</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>📋 Step 2: View Inquiry Details</h3>
						<ul>
							
							<li>Details shown:
								<ul>
									<li>Inquiry Date, Inquiry Number</li>
									<li>Purchaser Name, RM/PM Name</li>
									<li>Required Quantity, Duration</li>							
									<li>Purchaser Remarks (if any)</li>
								</ul>
							</li>
							<li>Click <strong>View / Reply</strong> next to the inquiry.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/2ViewInquiry.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – View Inquiry</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/2ViewInquiry.jpg" alt=" View Inquiry">
							</li>
						</ul>
						
						<h3>✏️ Step 3: Submit Price Quotation</h3>
						<ul>
							<li>Select <strong>Product Code/SKU/Trade Name</strong>.</li>
							<li>Enter:
							<ul>
								<li>Offer Price</li>
								<li>Price Valid Upto</li>
								<li>Delivery Time (days)</li>
								<li>Purity %</li>
								<li>Choose a Warehouse and specify the Packing details.</li>
								<li>Terms & Conditions (auto-attached if mapped)</li>
							
								<li>Negotiable? (Yes/No)</li>
							</ul>
							</li>
							<li>Click <strong> Submit Reply </strong> to respond to the purchaser.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/3SubmitReply.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – Submit Reply</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/3SubmitReply.jpg" alt=" Submit Reply">
							</li>
						</ul>
						


						<h3>🔄 Step 4: Handle Revised Price </h3>
						<ul>
							<li>If the purchaser proposes a revised price, you will receive another notification.<br>
							<em>“Price revised #INQ03072510112 – Revised price based on an offline discussion.”</em></li>
							<li>Click the bell icon to access the inquiry again and submit your final response.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/4RevisedPriceNotification.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – Revised Price Notification</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/4RevisedPriceNotification.jpg" alt="Revised Price Notification">
							</li>
						</ul>
						

						<h3>🔍 Step 5: View Revised Price </h3>
						<ul>
							<li>Click <strong>View/Reply</strong> to check the revised price and remarks.</li>
							<li>Review the purchaser's revised price and any remarks.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/5ViewReply.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – View Revised Price</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/5ViewReply.jpg" alt="View Revised Price">
							</li>
						</ul>
							

						<h3>💼 Step 6: Submit Final Price</h3>
						<ul>
							<li>You can accept or provide a new <strong>Final Price</strong> and <strong>Final Quantity</strong>.</li>
							<li>Click <strong>Submit Final Price</strong> to finalize your offer.</li>
							<li>
								<h3><a href="assets/images/SellerInquiry/6SubmitFinalPrice.jpg" target="_blank"> Screenshot – Submit Final Price</a></h3>
								<img src="assets/images/SellerInquiry/6SubmitFinalPrice.jpg" alt="Submit Final Price">
							</li>
							
						</ul>
					

						<h3>📌 Notes & Validation</h3>
						<ul>
							<li>Only <strong>Active products</strong> can be used to reply to inquiries.</li>
							<li>Mapped Terms & Conditions are attached automatically.</li>
							<li>Once <strong>Final Price</strong> is submitted, it cannot be edited.</li>
						</ul>
					</section>
				
				</section>
								
			</section>
							
